[{"text": "The seventh plenary meeting of the", "start": 2.28, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "General Assembly is called to order.", "start": 4.52, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": ">> [laughter]", "start": 10.48, "duration": 3.2}, {"text": ">> The The Assembly will hear an address by", "start": 10.68, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "His Excellency Ahmad Al-Shara, President", "start": 13.68, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "of the Syrian Arab Republic.", "start": 17.16, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "I request protocol to escort His", "start": 19.84, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "Excellency and invite him to address the", "start": 22.24, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "Assembly.", "start": 25.36, "duration": 2.56}, {"text": ">> Bismillah Rahman Rahim.", "start": 48.92, "duration": 2.52}, {"text": ">> In the name of God, the Most Gracious,", "start": 50.36, "duration": 3.8}, {"text": "the Most Compassionate.", "start": 51.44, "duration": 2.72}, {"text": "We have always focused on people.", "start": 55.92, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "Between good and evil,", "start": 60.6, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "reconstruction and destruction,", "start": 62.48, "duration": 4.359}, {"text": "peoples have struggled.", "start": 67.28, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "This struggle between good and evil", "start": 71.52, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "continues. However,", "start": 74.0, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "good people", "start": 76.4, "duration": 2.84}, {"text": "choose the right path.", "start": 79.72, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "Those who fight are very different from", "start": 81.68, "duration": 5.88}, {"text": "those who engage in bloodshed.", "start": 84.24, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "People can be very cruel to each other", "start": 87.56, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "if they resort to injustice.", "start": 90.32, "duration": 3.56}, {"text": "When land is usurped,", "start": 95.88, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "when sanctity is violated,", "start": 98.56, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "people suffer.", "start": 101.64, "duration": 4.84}, {"text": "And people pay", "start": 104.0, "duration": 5.32}, {"text": "the price.", "start": 106.48, "duration": 2.84}, {"text": "Falsehood forces people to", "start": 109.4, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "confront evil.", "start": 111.96, "duration": 7.8}, {"text": "Many wars were waged over history.", "start": 115.48, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "Unfortunately, our region has seen many", "start": 120.44, "duration": 4.92}, {"text": "of these wars.", "start": 123.44, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "Sometimes the truth prevails, sometimes", "start": 125.36, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "the truth does not.", "start": 128.399, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "Not all peace is just. Wars has taught", "start": 130.96, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "us that injustice does not", "start": 133.68, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "continue forever.", "start": 138.08, "duration": 3.12}, {"text": "Your Excellency, Mr. Kahlid Rahman,", "start": 141.4, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "President of the General Assembly, your", "start": 143.72, "duration": 3.32}, {"text": "Excellency Antonio Guterres, Secretary", "start": 145.08, "duration": 2.879}, {"text": "General of the United Nations, your", "start": 147.04, "duration": 2.0}, {"text": "majesties, your highnesses, your", "start": 147.959, "duration": 3.041}, {"text": "excellencies, may the peace, mercy, and", "start": 149.04, "duration": 3.88}, {"text": "blessings of God be upon you. A year", "start": 151.0, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "ago, I stood before you representing my", "start": 152.92, "duration": 5.16}, {"text": "people for the first time in 60 years. I", "start": 155.0, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "recall the victory of our people and", "start": 158.08, "duration": 4.12}, {"text": "stressed that this is a victory for the", "start": 160.24, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "world as a whole. Today,", "start": 162.2, "duration": 3.8}, {"text": "I convey to you the facts, the", "start": 166.08, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "achievements, to go through the", "start": 168.44, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "breakthrough we have achieved.", "start": 171.6, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "Last year, I mentioned that Syria came", "start": 173.959, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "back. Today, I say that Syria is rising.", "start": 176.84, "duration": 6.44}, {"text": "Ladies and gentlemen, in our journey in", "start": 180.519, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "the struggle between good and evil,", "start": 183.28, "duration": 5.8}, {"text": "the bloodshed was stopped, destruction", "start": 186.76, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "was stopped. Syria started the journey", "start": 189.08, "duration": 6.6}, {"text": "of reconstruction, of recovery.", "start": 191.4, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "The country was united. We controlled", "start": 196.4, "duration": 6.28}, {"text": "arms. We rebuilt military and civilian", "start": 200.04, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "institutions. Sanctions were lifted.", "start": 202.68, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "Projects for reconstructions have", "start": 204.92, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "continued. We have", "start": 206.84, "duration": 4.76}, {"text": "combated drug trafficking,", "start": 209.16, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "and we focused on transitional justice.", "start": 211.6, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "We have ascertained the fate of the", "start": 214.519, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "missing. We turned our vision into", "start": 217.28, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "practical action.", "start": 219.88, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "We have forged partnerships.", "start": 221.84, "duration": 3.8}, {"text": "And we focused mainly on the future and", "start": 226.0, "duration": 4.76}, {"text": "on the welfare of our people. We focus", "start": 228.16, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "on reconstruction. We relied on the free", "start": 230.76, "duration": 6.2}, {"text": "will of our people and our independence.", "start": 233.84, "duration": 5.96}, {"text": "This national vision", "start": 236.96, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "relied on diplomatic efforts.", "start": 239.8, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "Since liberation", "start": 242.56, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "more than 100 states started", "start": 244.88, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "communicating with us.", "start": 247.0, "duration": 7.48}, {"text": "Through 4,000 communications our capital", "start": 249.2, "duration": 8.039}, {"text": "has hosted more than 60 diplomatic", "start": 254.48, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "missions.", "start": 257.239, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "Syria has restored its status", "start": 259.28, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "in the international", "start": 261.64, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "community. It has been a transit", "start": 264.08, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "for the world.", "start": 267.96, "duration": 2.92}, {"text": "We also built diplomatic bridges and in", "start": 271.08, "duration": 6.76}, {"text": "parallel we proved to the world that the", "start": 273.48, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "security of the region", "start": 277.84, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "has to start in Damascus.", "start": 280.28, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "With seven states we started a group the", "start": 283.52, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "breath of", "start": 287.48, "duration": 7.96}, {"text": "freedom to destroy the chemical weapons", "start": 289.04, "duration": 8.04}, {"text": "file.", "start": 295.44, "duration": 3.8}, {"text": "We have been working with the OPCW and", "start": 297.08, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "we are working with the IAEA with", "start": 299.24, "duration": 4.2}, {"text": "transparency as we believe that", "start": 301.64, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "collective security is our duty. The", "start": 303.44, "duration": 5.72}, {"text": "strict implementation of our treaties", "start": 305.64, "duration": 7.32}, {"text": "spares our world the horrors of chemical", "start": 309.16, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "weapons and nuclear weapons.", "start": 312.96, "duration": 4.36}, {"text": "We combated", "start": 314.84, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "transnational crime.", "start": 317.32, "duration": 8.2}, {"text": "We have seized large amounts of Captagon", "start": 320.2, "duration": 8.6}, {"text": "and we combated the smuggling in people", "start": 325.52, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "and organized crime.", "start": 328.8, "duration": 5.16}, {"text": "Stability and security has been", "start": 331.12, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "established. We are no longer isolated.", "start": 333.96, "duration": 6.84}, {"text": "The Caesar Act was repealed.", "start": 337.44, "duration": 6.04}, {"text": "Also, sanctions were lifted and", "start": 340.8, "duration": 4.119}, {"text": "culminated in cooperation with the", "start": 343.48, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "European Union. Also, we are no longer", "start": 344.919, "duration": 5.961}, {"text": "part of the list of state sponsors of", "start": 348.36, "duration": 5.32}, {"text": "terrorism.", "start": 350.88, "duration": 2.8}, {"text": "We have", "start": 359.92, "duration": 4.12}, {"text": "started production. We have more than", "start": 361.56, "duration": 4.68}, {"text": "5,000 production line. We have seen an", "start": 364.04, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "increase in agricultural", "start": 366.24, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "production to ensure self-sufficiency.", "start": 368.2, "duration": 5.88}, {"text": "We also enhance the service sector.", "start": 371.2, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "The housing sector have been focused on.", "start": 374.08, "duration": 6.36}, {"text": "We recovered", "start": 376.72, "duration": 3.72}, {"text": "3.5 million refugees and IDPs have", "start": 380.88, "duration": 7.24}, {"text": "returned in a safe and decent way. Syria", "start": 384.64, "duration": 8.36}, {"text": "turned from a crisis to an opportunity", "start": 388.12, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "for many countries.", "start": 393.52, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "We believe in", "start": 395.8, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "human resources.", "start": 398.64, "duration": 3.32}, {"text": "Any development planning", "start": 403.16, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "for the region", "start": 405.76, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "that ignores Syria would be flawed.", "start": 407.48, "duration": 6.68}, {"text": "And the price would be heavy.", "start": 412.48, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "Ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 414.16, "duration": 4.04}, {"text": "these initiatives", "start": 416.4, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "focus on the recovery of citizens in", "start": 418.2, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "Syria.", "start": 421.28, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "This is why we focused on safe and", "start": 422.72, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "dignified", "start": 425.8, "duration": 3.8}, {"text": "return. We", "start": 427.2, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "launched the initiative", "start": 429.6, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "Syria without refugee camps to end this", "start": 431.36, "duration": 3.559}, {"text": "area.", "start": 433.88, "duration": 3.64}, {"text": "We have reconstructed universities and", "start": 434.919, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "schools to maintain educational services", "start": 437.52, "duration": 5.96}, {"text": "to all Syrian citizens.", "start": 440.04, "duration": 6.44}, {"text": "And we have consolidated our values. We", "start": 443.48, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "have consolidated the rule of law.", "start": 446.48, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "Any attempts", "start": 449.8, "duration": 2.84}, {"text": "that violate our sovereignty, violate", "start": 453.04, "duration": 5.0}, {"text": "international law will be stopped. Golan", "start": 455.44, "duration": 6.12}, {"text": "will remain Syrian territories.", "start": 458.04, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "Any", "start": 461.56, "duration": 5.48}, {"text": "other attempts", "start": 463.96, "duration": 3.08}, {"text": "will be thwarted according to Security", "start": 467.28, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "Council resolution", "start": 470.2, "duration": 4.2}, {"text": "497.", "start": 472.56, "duration": 3.56}, {"text": "I thank all of those who abided by the", "start": 474.4, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "international law.", "start": 476.12, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "And I thank those who refrained from", "start": 478.4, "duration": 3.52}, {"text": "interpreting", "start": 480.4, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "resolution 497. This resolution is clear", "start": 481.92, "duration": 5.32}, {"text": "and I ask our partners to abide by", "start": 484.92, "duration": 3.2}, {"text": "international law and by this", "start": 487.24, "duration": 2.68}, {"text": "resolution.", "start": 488.12, "duration": 5.72}, {"text": "The world is joyed about our return, but", "start": 489.92, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Israel", "start": 493.84, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "is launching attacks against Syria.", "start": 495.04, "duration": 7.48}, {"text": "There have been 500 air strikes, more", "start": 499.12, "duration": 8.04}, {"text": "than 1,200 incursions, and 300", "start": 502.52, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "detentions.", "start": 507.16, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "This is at odds with the orientation", "start": 509.4, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "we're seeing at global level. It is", "start": 511.4, "duration": 6.199}, {"text": "reminiscent of a era that we thought it", "start": 513.479, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "was long", "start": 517.599, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "gone.", "start": 519.56, "duration": 4.12}, {"text": "We are committed to the 1974 agreement.", "start": 521.039, "duration": 5.161}, {"text": "We call for the withdrawal of Israeli", "start": 523.68, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "forces to the lines of the 8th of", "start": 526.2, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "December 2024. We reject Israeli", "start": 529.68, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "attempts to impose a fait accompli. We", "start": 532.2, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "reject their aggressions which", "start": 533.6, "duration": 5.08}, {"text": "undermines peace and security. The", "start": 536.76, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "opportunity for peace and security is", "start": 538.68, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "available to those who wish to live in", "start": 540.839, "duration": 4.041}, {"text": "peace and just peace that maintains the", "start": 543.0, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "rights of all. In conclusion, the war", "start": 544.88, "duration": 5.16}, {"text": "has taught us that truth is strong", "start": 546.92, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "and that falsehood is weak.", "start": 550.04, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "Syria", "start": 552.56, "duration": 2.84}, {"text": "will continue its reconstruction. We'll", "start": 553.96, "duration": 3.64}, {"text": "continue to restore its dignity. From", "start": 555.4, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "this rostrum,", "start": 557.6, "duration": 2.92}, {"text": "I recited the verse in the Quran, truth", "start": 561.04, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "has come and falsehood has vanished.", "start": 563.88, "duration": 3.959}, {"text": "Indeed, falsehood is bound to vanish. We", "start": 565.839, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "will continue to serve our people. We", "start": 567.839, "duration": 3.161}, {"text": "will", "start": 569.839, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "work to serve God. God will always", "start": 571.0, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "reward you for your actions.", "start": 575.12, "duration": 5.88}, {"text": "We have generated momentum", "start": 578.84, "duration": 3.52}, {"text": "with those who supported us. We", "start": 581.0, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "appreciate all countries that raised", "start": 582.36, "duration": 5.32}, {"text": "their flags in Damascus. We thank the", "start": 585.72, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "international organizations that", "start": 587.68, "duration": 2.92}, {"text": "believed in partnership with us, that", "start": 588.72, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "worked with us.", "start": 590.6, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "We came to you at the 80th session to", "start": 592.72, "duration": 5.56}, {"text": "announce that we are back and at the", "start": 595.56, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "81st session, we came to you to provide", "start": 598.28, "duration": 7.08}, {"text": "our achievements and at the 82nd", "start": 603.0, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "session, we'll come together again to", "start": 605.36, "duration": 3.72}, {"text": "gain the fruits of strategic", "start": 607.56, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "partnerships, partnerships that made", "start": 609.08, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "Syria an international actor that builds", "start": 611.16, "duration": 8.56}, {"text": "prosperity, a model to lead stability.", "start": 614.28, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "A vital part that is open to a bright", "start": 619.72, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "future. May the peace, mercy, and", "start": 622.2, "duration": 5.0}, {"text": "blessings of God be upon you.", "start": 624.0, "duration": 3.2}, {"text": ">> On behalf of the assembly, I", "start": 630.6, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "I wish to thank the president of the", "start": 634.12, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Syrian Arab Republic.", "start": 636.36, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "The assembly will now hear", "start": 640.76, "duration": 3.68}]